    "U1: Implement a new Java SDK (Java 8+) from scratch communicating with peers/orderers via gRPC using Fabric protobuf definitions, with pluggable crypto (Bouncy Castle), MSP enrollment support, YAML/JSON connection profiles, and peer event service integration.",
